The French Data Transfer pipeline is composed of two separate pipelines

The first is the UniteLegale, or legal, pipeline, which contains data regarding french companies. It is
reasonably similar to the data found in Companies House

The Etablissement (Etab) file contains the address data for each company.

It should be noted that the UniteLegale file MUST be processed before the Etab file. If not, there will be
errors regarding the foreign key between preprod.organisation and preprod.geo_location. This will be because
an organisation id hasnt been created for the addresses in Etab.

Documentation and translations for each of the columns in the Legal and Etab file can be found at

https://www.sirene.fr/static-resources/htm/v_sommaire_311.htm#7

